00760,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMDc2MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/300760?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard","html_url":"https://github.com/emmanuelbernard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":397,"state":"closed","created_at":"2020-04-07T13:38:08Z","updated_at":"2020-07-21T13:05:26Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2020-05-20T19:24:13Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2020-03-29T10:35:35Z","updated_at":"2020-05-18T14:30:16Z","closed_at":"2020-05-18T08:05:15Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Describe the bug**\r\nRunning a `@QuarkusTest` fails with a `java.lang.ClassCastException`, see [MWE](https://github.com/schulzp/quarkus-classcast-mwe).\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nThe tests passes.\r\n\r\n**Actual behavior**\r\nWhen using `@ParameterizedTest` with `@MethodSource`, see [MWE](https://github.com/schulzp/quarkus-classcast-mwe), the test fails with the following exception:\r\n`java.lang.ClassCastException: class org.hamcrest.core.Is cannot be cast to class org.hamcrest.Matcher (org.hamcrest.core.Is is in unnamed module of loader 'app'; org.hamcrest.Matcher is in unnamed module of loader io.quarkus.bootstrap.classloading.QuarkusClassLoader @7188af83)`\r\n\r\nHowever, if the test parameters are [mapped manually](https://github.com/schulzp/quarkus-classcast-mwe/blob/master/src/test/java/com/example/ExampleResourceTest.java#L28) (using a regular `@Test`) it passes.\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\nSteps to reproduce the behavior:\r\n1. Check out the [MWE](https://github.com/schulzp/quarkus-classcast-mwe)\r\n2. run `./mvnw verify`\r\n\r\n**Configuration**\r\n```properties\r\n# no properties are set explicitly\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Environment (please complete the following information):**\r\n - Output of `uname -a` or `ver`:\r\n   ```\r\n   Darwin Kernel Version 19.3.0; root:xnu-6153.81.5~1/RELEASE_X86_64 x86_64\r\n   ```\r\n - Output of `java -version`: `11.0.1, vendor: Oracle Corporation`\r\n - Quarkus version or git rev: `1.3.1.Final`\r\n - Build tool (ie. output of `mvnw --version` or `gradlew --version`): \r\n   ```\r\n   Apache Maven 3.6.3 (cecedd343002696d0abb50b32b541b8a6ba2883f)\r\n   Java version: 11.0.1, vendor: Oracle Corporation, runtime: [...]\r\n   Default locale: de_DE, platform encoding: UTF-8\r\n   OS name: \"mac os x\", version: \"10.15.3\", arch: \"x86_64\", family: \"mac\"\r\n   ```\r\n**Additional context**\r\nThe behavior occurred when I upgraded quarkus from 1.2.1.Final to 1.3.0.Final/1.3.1.Final.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"geoand","id":4374975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNzQ5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4374975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/geoand","html_url":"https://github.com/geoand","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geoand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geoand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geoand/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geoand/starred{/own